{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"重言丛"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“重言丛”"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h3>$\\mathbb P^1$ 上的重言丛</h3>\n<p>$\\mathbb P^1$ 上的重言丛 $\\mathcal O(-1)$ 恰好是一个点对应的"},{"Local":{"url":"理想层","text":"理想层"}},{"Plain":", 有短正合列\n$$\r\n0\\to \\mathcal O(-1) \\to \\mathcal O \\to\\mathcal O_p\\to 0.\r\n$$\n见"},{"Local":{"url":"除子","text":"除子"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}